+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's cache eviction strategy is LRU (Least Recently Used), combined with a 300-second TTL that automatically expires cache entries regardless of access recency. This approach was adopted because the combination of recency-based eviction and time-based expiration provides more practical cache lifecycle management than frequency-based alternatives.
